recommend keep-going Season G open-media crux-first: the SKELETON template pack (the classic 8-rotation thinning pair the general driver now runs, reducing a real blob to its one-pixel medial line), then a corner/endpoint template pack and a disk-element builder. No network, no key, no funds -- all agent-doable on our own open geometry.
